# "Mill four cards. When you do, ..." triggers only if four cards were milled (CR 603.12): with a library of three
# Islands Bot1 mills all three (CR 701.17b) and the reflexive ability never goes on the stack, so no Island returns
# (ruling for the same template, Wick's Patrol, 2024-07-26). Positive control: primal-witchstalker-mills-then-targets-a-milled-land.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Primal Witchstalker
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

[Actions]
[Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Primal Witchstalker.Cast
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Library.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 5
Bot1.Battlefield = Primal Witchstalker
Stack.Count = 0
